#ASSERT `sch 11 para 5(3) CSA 20(4)(c) a purported appeal may be treated as an application for revision under section 16` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 5(3) CSA 20(4)(c) a purported appeal may be treated as an application for revision under section 16` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

